# Tests

- Parity: final_equity / sharpe vs notebook (toleransi ~1e-3).
- Look-ahead: entry time > signal bar time.
- Plugin isolation: `engine.strategies` tidak import backtester/metrics.
- Gate: OOS gagal => FAIL; 6/6 => ROBUST.
- Tes engine tanpa Django TestCase jika memungkinkan (`tests/test_engine_*.py`).
